{{else}}
- Build on the {{engine.name}} engine, taking the frame loop, rendering, the
  input actions, the pointer, audio, and the debug overlay from it, and writing
  the game inside its framework of game modes, actors, components, and
  controllers.
{{/if}}
- Ship both modes, Campaign and Cascade, each reachable from the title menu.
- Render real graphics on the canvas, drawn as shapes and text.
- Draw everything in code. The build ships no art or audio files and fetches
